  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will achieve its objective through Emergency Food Security Livelihood (EFSL), Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WaSH), Gender and Protection interventions as detailed in the Response Strategy.  Activities will be implemented through a mix of direct implementation and working with local partners.</narrative>
